{% set examples = {
  production: 'Your producer can update the run of show, assign the crew and give the welcome desk a current guest list. Your team keeps access to its agreed workspace for future events.',
  corporate: 'Registration, guest check-in, presenter cues and crew responsibilities can share one workspace. Your team can reuse it for its next event.',
  activation: 'Give the activation team its schedule and deliverables. Visitor follow-up uses the consent and access agreed with the organizer.',
  nonprofit: 'Coordinate guests and companions, volunteer shifts and sponsor commitments. Approved year-round tools can support donations, sign-ups and future fundraisers.',
  edition: 'Once your participation is confirmed, your team can track its agreed deliverables, artwork deadlines and event-day assignments.'
} %}
<section class="vp-value{{ compact|default(false) ? ' vp-value--compact' : '' }}" aria-labelledby="partner-system-title">
  <div class="vp-value__inner">
    <h2 id="partner-system-title">{{ audience == 'edition' ? 'Your sponsor workspace' : 'VNV-Q is included within your agreed scope' }}</h2>
    <p>{{ examples[audience] }}</p>
    <p>Setup and access for the agreed tools carry no additional platform fee. This applies to paid productions and sponsorships, as well as approved no-fee and in-kind partnerships. The agreement defines the team’s permissions and any third-party costs.</p>
    {% if audience != 'edition' %}<a href="{{ path('vnv-support') }}">Explore VNV-Q Event Software <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
